<title>USA: Omaha cattle $2.00 lower in slow trade - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle $2.00 lower in slow trade - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers traded slow with prices fully $2.00 lower. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Select and Choice 2-4 1100-1300 lbs 64.00-65.50, those over 65.00 mostly Choice. Select 61.00-64.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Select and Choice 2-4 950-1150 lbs 64.00-65.00, few 65.50. Select 60.00-64.00.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
</text>
